            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi The B",
            "review_text": "jamesdoyle97\nHanoi, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nMost interesting and Unexpected\nMay 2020\nI noticed this place first during the lockdown in Hanoi and it appeared to have a very busy takeaway business. When it reopened for eat in, I decided to give it a try. Space is small downstairs but more room upstairs. A no nonsense menu Japanese/Korean cuisine, offers very tasty individually prepared food at a very reasonable price.\nIt is very popular with young Vietnamese and well worth a visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 16, 2020",
